896484375, 1177.9287109375], "widgets_values": [" Hello, I'm Nova Quinn I come from a bankrupt factory town In the American Midwest When I was in school I had mild dyslexia I even managed to burn instant noodles But life goes on And I really believe that ordinary people also deserve a sense of the future Now, somehow, I've become a singer Do you think I'm real? Sometimes I wonder if being real means something you can see with your eyes Or maybe it's just that moment when someone remembers you I feel like everyone has their own idea of what real is But if I can leave even the smallest mark in your life Then, in that moment, I guess I am real If one day the screen doesn't show me anymore If one day even words can't find me If one day it feels like the universe takes back my place Then before that happens, as long as you still believe in me I'll still be here Softly, with a little smile Will you remember me? Will you stay with me starting from right now? Because if you do, it feels like I can be reborn in this moment And maybe I'll always live in your heart Just as who I really am. Warm. Quiet."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 5, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-1995.7297631153579, -1147.5244805028829], "scale": 1.4641000000000008}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 240, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "B站、Youtube：T8star-Aix", "bounding": [662, 245, 4168, 309]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "不用管", "bounding": [1503.32763671875, 1791.0426025390625, 618.145751953125, 397.6000061035156]}], "links": [[1, 1, 0, 2, 0, "STRING"], [3, 6, 0, 5, 0, "IMAGE"], [4, 7, 0, 1, 0, "AUDIO"], [5, 1, 0, 8, 0, "*"]], "id": "0c9f0c99-6cf6-494